FilaManBambuUsage
=================

This project contains logic ported from OpenSpoolMan.

    OpenSpoolMan
    https://github.com/drndos/openspoolman
    Copyright (c) 2024 Filip Bednarik
    Licensed under the MIT License

The following areas are derived from that project and were reimplemented
against FilaMan's data model rather than Spoolman's:

  - Extraction of per-filament consumption from the Bambu 3MF archive
    (Metadata/slice_info.config), see bambu_usage/threemf.py
  - Mapping of slicer filament slots to physical AMS trays via the
    ams_mapping reported with the print command, see bambu_usage/tracker.py
  - The print history model with per-slot consumption and manual correction,
    see bambu_usage/models.py

No code was taken from the FilaMan plugin repositories
(Fire-Devils/filaman-bambulab-plugin, filaman-spoolmanapi-plugin,
filaman-bambuddy-plugin). At the time of writing those repositories carry no
LICENSE file and are therefore all rights reserved. They were read as a
structural reference for the plugin manifest and module layout only.

FilaMan itself (Fire-Devils/filaman-system) is MIT licensed. This plugin
imports from its public application modules at runtime but ships none of its
code.
